    docs: rewrite quickstart §3d plugin loading to directory + plugins.enabled discovery. Addresses TJ-DF-021.
    
    The documented HERMES_PLUGINS env-var mechanism is not part of Hermes core
    plugin discovery: core scans ~/.hermes/plugins/<name>/ (plugin.yaml manifest)
    and gates on the plugins.enabled config allow-list (hermes_cli/plugins.py:
    collect_directory_manifests / _gate_manifest), plus pip entry points.
    §3d now documents the cp -r install, the config gate (yaml snippet +
    `hermes plugins enable`), restart + agent.log verification, the accurate hook
    surface (pre_tool_call observer + transform_terminal_output stub), and a
    version-lag note (installed 0.2.0 vs repo 1.2.0) with the refresh step.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
